cff-version: 1.2.0
title: HELIX
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Karim
    family-names: Elmaaroufi
    website: 'https://github.com/KE7'
version: "0.2.1"
date-released: "2026-05-10"
repository-code: 'https://github.com/KE7/helix'
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  HELIX is an evolutionary optimization framework for whole
  code repositories. It uses coding-agent CLIs as the mutation
  operator and git worktrees as the population, with a
  reflective Pareto search loop ported from GEPA
  optimize_anything.
